  The reel_script and caption state that the 24-year-old complainant Abinesh is the one who filed the complaint about his bike being stolen; the article says he did, so this is consistent, but the caption and reel also say 'பொள்ளாச்சி அருகே' (near Pollachi) for the accident, while the article places the accident at Malumichampatti without giving a distance from Pollachi, so 'near Pollachi' is an invented detail.
